  "understanding": {
    "confirmed": [
      {
        "id": "F-001",
        "text": "项目目标：PC 本地运行的实时语音 Companion，角色为派蒙。核心体验是低延迟、自然轮次、可打断、适度主动插话，不是一问一答式语音助手。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-002",
        "text": "第一阶段范围限制：不做 3D/X4 Air/直播平台/手机 App/视觉理解/长期记忆/自训练 ASR、TTS、LLM。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-003",
        "text": "技术方向：Python + Pipecat 作为实时语音 pipeline 底盘；轮次检测用 Silero VAD + Pipecat Smart Turn。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-004",
        "text": "ASR/LLM/TTS 全部通过 Provider 抽象接入，业务层不直接 import 供应商 SDK；LLM 第一版用 OpenAI-compatible adapter。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-005",
        "text": "TTS 第一阶段赛马候选：Fish Audio、MiniMax、ElevenLabs；CosyVoice 为后续自部署候选。选型标准为低 TTFA、中文自然度、情绪表现、可 streaming、易取消。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-006",
        "text": "ASR 第一阶段使用低延迟云端 Streaming ASR API；FunASR/SenseVoice/Whisper 类方案后续再评估。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-007",
        "text": "项目核心资产是 Conversation Core：TurnManager、InterruptionManager、InitiativePolicy、ContextManager、Conversation State Machine、Persona/Behavior Policy、Latency Metrics。模型可换，这部分必须自己写。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-008",
        "text": "对话状态机最小集合：IDLE / LISTENING / POSSIBLE_END / THINKING / SPEAKING / INTERRUPTED / SILENCED。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-009",
        "text": "上下文管理区分 Logical History（模型生成了什么）与 Heard History（用户实际听到了什么），被打断时不能混写。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-010",
        "text": "LLM 输出结构化结果（speech/emotion/energy/should_continue），为未来 TTS 情绪、表情、3D 动作扩展预留接口。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-011",
        "text": "第一版开发使用耳机，暂时规避 AEC/回声消除问题；产品化后再考虑 WebRTC AEC。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-012",
        "text": "第一版 UI 为 Terminal，无需 GUI；MVP 目标 SEFA 500–800ms 区间、连续运行 ≥10 分钟、可替换 ≥2 个 LLM 与 ≥2 个 TTS Provider、有基础 latency log。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "F-013",
        "text": "主动性策略第一版用可解释评分规则，硬规则优先：用户说话中或 SILENCED 状态下 NEVER_SPEAK；第一版默认不真正打断正在讲话的用户。",
        "source": "conversation",
        "at": "2026-09-21T12:48:55.124Z"
      },
      {
